  "notes": "Hostile late-campaign state actor (proposal). Chinese gear is also the export kit of several enemy factions (Pakistan-linked groups, African and Middle East forces). Direct PLA combat should stay a late-game, high-stakes theatre (taiwan_strait, south_china_sea); earlier encounters are proxies and Chinese export equipment. PLA has fought no war since 1979; avoid portraying unverified atrocities or capabilities beyond public sources. Job 7 (Captain, 2026-10-10): chn appears as UN peacekeepers on eastern_congo (alliance monusco, member_status what_if: China's MONUSCO engineer and medical contingent actually left in April 2024, so a returning contingent is a game what-if) and on lebanon_south (UNIFIL, per alliances.json; now also listed in theatres so factions_present matches). Peacekeepers are neutral units on those maps.",
